 equal to ${f}^{′}(3).$ Computing the derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{5}-8{x}^{4}+24{x}^{2}-16) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 5{x}^{4}-8\\cdot 4{x}^{3}+24\\cdot 2x-0 \\\\  & =10{x}^{4}-32{x}^{3}+48x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate at $x=3$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(3) & =10({3}^{4})-32({3}^{3})+48(3) \\\\  & =810-864+144 \\\\  & =90.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at $x=3$ is\n\n$$\nm={f}^{′}(3)=90.\n$$"] ["question-def70879-cf84-5b54-bdb7-d96481c22cc6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3" :answer-field/id #uuid "51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3"] ["answer-47783d62-c870-5147-b953-7ccd97997d07" :answer/id #uuid "47783d62-c870-5147-b953-7ccd97997d07"] ["answer-47783d62-c870-5147-b953-7ccd97997d07" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-47783d62-c870-5147-b953-7ccd97997d07" :answer/value "90"] ["answer-field-51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3" :answer-field/correct "answer-47783d62-c870-5147-b953-7ccd97997d07"] ["answer-field-51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3" :answer-field/choices "answer-47783d62-c870-5147-b953-7ccd97997d07"] ["question-def70879-cf84-5b54-bdb7-d96481c22cc6" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-51c33fc1-b49f-5319-ad00-3e78fb97a0a3"] [17592186064342 :knowledge-point/questions "question-def70879-cf84-5b54-bdb7-d96481c22cc6"] ["question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb" :question/id #uuid "bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb"] ["question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb" :question/math-academy-id "q-342248"] ["question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the $x$-coordinate of the point on the curve $y={x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}+12x$ whose tangent has a slope of $0.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}"] ["question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)={x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}+12x.$ The slope of the tangent at the point $x$ is equal to ${f}^{′}(x).$ Computing the derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}+12x) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}-12x+12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now set ${f}^{′}(x)=0$ and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-12x+12 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-4x+4 & =0 \\\\ (x-2)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent is equal to $0$ at the point where $x=2.$"] ["question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08" :answer-field/id #uuid "40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08"] ["answer-c8bcc3fc-12cf-5236-886b-39227298c64c" :answer/id #uuid "c8bcc3fc-12cf-5236-886b-39227298c64c"] ["answer-c8bcc3fc-12cf-5236-886b-39227298c64c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c8bcc3fc-12cf-5236-886b-39227298c64c" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-field-40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08" :answer-field/correct "answer-c8bcc3fc-12cf-5236-886b-39227298c64c"] ["answer-field-40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08" :answer-field/choices "answer-c8bcc3fc-12cf-5236-886b-39227298c64c"] ["question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-40385704-7f81-5553-874b-03df9d2fbb08"] [17592186064259 :knowledge-point/questions "question-bc8ddc72-3ceb-5b31-bf69-44ea85d72dfb"] ["activity-46c1e53f-62e6-5392-ab4c-e6bdacff7e8d" :activity/id #uuid "46c1e53f-62e6-5392-ab4c-e6bdacff7e8d"] ["step-59f40366-9408-58ed-ba6e-660cf3a0f426" :step/id #uuid "59f40366-9408-58ed-ba6e-660cf3a0f426"] ["step-7aefa325-8ae5-5542-9f23-5d3b6f99204e" :step